{
    "title": "Driving Test \u2013 Road Junctions",
    "description": "<b><h2>SAFE DRIVING PRACTICE TEST FOR JUNCTIONS</h2></b>\r\nAre you looking for driving rules and road sign tests for junctions to test or improve your driving knowledge?\r\n\r\nWell, try <b>Driving Test \u2013 Road Junctions</b> and you are sure to learn to drive more safely.\r\n\r\nExperienced drivers and instructors often emphasize: junction observation is the most important part of driving.\r\n\r\nIs it safe?\r\nIs it convenient?\r\nIs it legal?\r\nWho has the advantage?\r\n\r\nWith our junction practice driving test you will learn to make good observations in all directions before emerging.\r\nWhether you want to fully prepare for a DMV driving test, DMV road test, or simply want to do a personal driver knowledge test, this intersections and crossroads test app is sure to help you and improve your driver knowledge & driving skills.\r\n\r\n<b><h2>DRIVING QUIZ WITH 150 DIFFERENT JUNCTIONS AND TRAFFIC SITUATIONS</h2></b>\r\n\ud83d\ude98Learn to drive in a safer way with our intersection driver knowledge test that includes all possible junction and traffic situations. Our road signs test features images to help <u>visually understand the intersection rules</u>. Additionally, our explanations will prepare you to be road ready and boost your driving skills.\r\n\r\n\u2139\ufe0f<b>WHY TRY THIS DRIVING SKILLS TEST</b>\r\n<font color=\"\u201dRed\u201d\">The risk of intersection collisions takes around 50% of urban crashes and 30% of rural crashes occurring at junctions</font>. As a driver, you must see and react correctly to all road signs and markings to practice safe driving. Failing to comply with traffic signs will get you in a serious or potentially dangerous situation - or a test fail.\r\n\r\nOur intersection & road sign test helps you learn to drive in an effective way. After completing the traffic junction driving knowledge test questions you should learn:\r\n- not endanger other road users by pulling out in front of them.\r\n- not sit waiting at junctions, allowing safe gaps to pass.\r\n- not to overreact to minor hazards.\r\n- not drive unnecessarily slowly, when it is safe and proper to drive at normal road speeds.\r\nIn short: our road driving test app will help drivers learn to drive and practice safe driving.\r\n\r\n\u26a0\ufe0f<b>PRACTICE DRIVING TEST \u2013 JUNCTIONS APP FEATURES:</b>\r\n\u2023 All possible situations - Over 150 different junctions and traffic situations.\r\n\u2023 Explanations - Explanations to help you learn and understand the correct answer.\r\n\u2023 Global high score list - Compare your knowledge with other drivers around the world.\r\n\u2023 Daily progress - Keeps track of all your scores and progress.\r\n\u2023Compare your driving knowledge \u2013 See how other drivers answered the driving test question.\r\n\u2023 Driver test timer \u2013 realistic timer to help you better prepare for the driving license test\r\n\u2023 Offline mode - Use of already downloaded tests without an internet connection.\r\n\r\nHave a driving school in your pocket 24/7 that tests and improves your driving skills and helps you drive safer. Because safe driving is smart driving.\r\n\r\n\u2611\ufe0f<b>Download and use Driving Test \u2013 Road Junctions for FREE!</b>\r\n___________________\r\n\r\nREACH OUT\r\nIf you have any queries regarding this practice driving test app, please send them to dzano.catovic@gmail.com. Till then improve your driving skills by learning driving rules with this detailed and helpful driving test app.",
    "descriptionHTML": "<b><h2>SAFE DRIVING PRACTICE TEST FOR JUNCTIONS</h2></b><br>Are you looking for driving rules and road sign tests for junctions to test or improve your driving knowledge?<br><br>Well, try <b>Driving Test \u2013 Road Junctions</b> and you are sure to learn to drive more safely.<br><br>Experienced drivers and instructors often emphasize: junction observation is the most important part of driving.<br><br>Is it safe?<br>Is it convenient?<br>Is it legal?<br>Who has the advantage?<br><br>With our junction practice driving test you will learn to make good observations in all directions before emerging.<br>Whether you want to fully prepare for a DMV driving test, DMV road test, or simply want to do a personal driver knowledge test, this intersections and crossroads test app is sure to help you and improve your driver knowledge &amp; driving skills.<br><br><b><h2>DRIVING QUIZ WITH 150 DIFFERENT JUNCTIONS AND TRAFFIC SITUATIONS</h2></b><br>\ud83d\ude98Learn to drive in a safer way with our intersection driver knowledge test that includes all possible junction and traffic situations. Our road signs test features images to help <u>visually understand the intersection rules</u>. Additionally, our explanations will prepare you to be road ready and boost your driving skills.<br><br>\u2139\ufe0f<b>WHY TRY THIS DRIVING SKILLS TEST</b><br><font color=\"\u201dRed\u201d\">The risk of intersection collisions takes around 50% of urban crashes and 30% of rural crashes occurring at junctions</font>. As a driver, you must see and react correctly to all road signs and markings to practice safe driving. Failing to comply with traffic signs will get you in a serious or potentially dangerous situation - or a test fail.<br><br>Our intersection &amp; road sign test helps you learn to drive in an effective way. After completing the traffic junction driving knowledge test questions you should learn:<br>- not endanger other road users by pulling out in front of them.<br>- not